# THE BUILD

## Principle
One store, one write primitive, two mouths, two faces. Every word carries its source + history.

**Canonical store:**
```
srs_data_<id>   â†’ SM-2 map: { word, translation, interval, repetitions, ease_factor,
                               next_review, last_grade, source, first_seen, times_seen }
vocab_list_<id> â†’ display list (last 500): { word, meaning_vi, source, ts }
```
Kill all `srs:<id>:*` orphan keys â€” nothing should write them after this run.

